          "html": "<section class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-secondary transition duration-1000 ease\">\n  <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-8 lg:px-6 lg:py-12 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-8 sm:gap-16 lg:gap-24 xl:gap-32\">\n    <h1 class=\"text-5xl font-bold text-primary mb-10 lg:mb-16\" style=\"animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out both;\">Overview of Services</h1>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4 sm:gap-8 lg:gap-12 xl:gap-16\">\n      <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-700 mb-4 lg:mb-8\" style=\"animation: fadeInUp 0.4s ease-in-out both;\">A brief description of the services we offer.</p>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4 sm:gap-8 lg:gap-12 xl:gap-16\">\n        <button role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Service 1\" class=\"btn btn-primary hover:bg-secondary text-white border-none font-bold py-3 px-4 rounded sm:px-6 sm:py-4 lg:px-8 lg:py-6 xl:px-10 xl:py-8\">Service 1</button>\n        <button role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Service 2\" class=\"btn btn-primary hover:bg-secondary text-white border-none font-bold py-3 px-4 rounded sm:px-6 sm:py-4 lg:px-8 lg:py-6 xl:px-10 xl:py-8\">Service 2</button>\n        <button role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Service 3\" class=\"btn btn-primary hover:bg-secondary text-white border-none font-bold py-3 px-4 rounded sm:px-6 sm:py-4 lg:px-8 lg:py-6 xl:px-10 xl:py-8\">Service 3</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
